<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1481"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Inquisitive<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Inquisitive<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->11-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, November 30, 2004 - 6:52 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I agree with Colette, it does look like boxing gloves. However the writing looks like July, 39&#39; or July 59&#39; to me.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
