<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST1678"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, December 09, 2004 - 1:10 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->The photo of the baby with the beaver/boxing gloves &#40;speculated&#41; on it&#39;s sweater looks like Shirley Vian.  <BR> <BR>A lot!  <BR> <BR>If you super-impose the two photos over each other they match up.  <BR> <BR>Look at their noses.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
