<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3658"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Hawk<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Hawk<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 07, 2005 - 2:22 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Hi, I&#39;m new to catch.BTK, but not to the baby photo or most of the well-known case info. I believe this to be a baby boy, BTK, and I think the letters on the shirt are J-U-A-N-O and possibly last lettter of S. <BR>Maybe just JUAN or JUANS. <BR> <BR>I have always thought the physical characteristics were Hispanic, but only recently started looking at the logo per se.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
