<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST3691"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 07, 2005 - 2:57 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Lilymarie, the noses are not the same &#40;Julie &amp; the Baby&#41;. <BR> <BR>However if you open a pic of the Baby &amp; one of Shirley Vian that are the same size and transpose them... they match.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
